# Bench to Rafters needs no environment variables to install, run, build or test.
# The game runs entirely in the browser: no server, no API keys, no accounts.
# Saved careers live in the player's own browser (localStorage), not in files.
#
# Optional, developer tools only (the balance harness in scripts/):
# Age at which the "smart" simulated player accepts a retirement prompt (default 32).
RETIRE_AGE=
